## Tech stack

- Flutter (Dart SDK `^3.9.0`), Material 3
- **State:** `flutter_bloc` + `equatable`
- **Navigation:** `go_router` → `lib/routes/app_router.dart`
- **Layout:** `flutter_screenutil` — design size `375×812` in `main.dart`
- **HTTP:** `package:http` via **`AppHttpClient.instance`** (`lib/core/network/app_http_client.dart`) — wraps **`NetworkAwareClient`**; never `http.get`/`http.post` at top level
- **Connectivity:** `ConnectivityService` + **`NoInternetDialog`** (global popup, Retry) — init in `main.dart`, `AppRouter.rootNavigatorKey`
- **Payments:** `flutter_stripe` — init in `main.dart` (`StripeConfig`)
- **Session:** `shared_preferences` via `SessionManager` (token, patientId, currencyId)
- **Loading UI:** `auto_skeleton` — global config in `main.dart`
- **Assets:** `assets/image/`, `assets/images/`, `assets/fonts/` (GeneralSans)

