## API flow

### Layered flow (preferred for new work)

```
UI (presentation/pages|widgets)
  → BLoC (presentation/bloc)
    → UseCase (domain/usecases) — optional
      → Repository (domain/repositories)
        → RepositoryImpl (data/repositories)
          → ApiService (data/datasource)
            → ApiEndpoints
  → SessionManager (token / patientId / currencyId)
```

**Rules:**
- **Never** call `http` from widgets or BLoCs.
- **Never** create per-request `http.Client()` — use `AppHttpClient.instance` (injectable in constructors for tests).
- **All URLs** in `lib/core/constants/api_endpoints.dart` only.
- **Auth:** `SessionManager.getToken()` / `getPatientId()`; save after OTP; `clearSession()` on logout.

