| `verifyOtp` | POST | No | auth |
| `saveProfile(patientId)` | POST | Bearer | auth |
| `categorySpecializations` | GET | Bearer | healing_focus |
| `savePreference(patientId)` | POST | Bearer | healing_focus |
| `approvedHealers` | POST | Bearer | healers / home |
| `approvedHealerDetails(healerId)` | GET | Bearer | healers |
| `walletBalance` | GET | Bearer | wallet |
| `walletTransactions` | GET | Bearer | wallet |
