## Directory layout

```
lib/
├── main.dart
├── routes/app_router.dart
├── core/
│   ├── constants/     # AppColors, AppTextStyles, ApiEndpoints, StripeConfig
│   ├── network/       # app_http_client.dart
│   └── utils/         # session_manager.dart
├── common/            # widgets, screens, utils
└── features/<name>/
    ├── data/          # models, datasource, repositories
    ├── domain/        # repositories, usecases
    └── presentation/  # bloc, pages, widgets
```

**Architecture note:** New features (`booking`, `my_sessions`, `wallet`) use clean layers. Some legacy features (`healers` bloc, `auth`) may call repository or api directly — **follow the local feature pattern**; migrate only when asked.

**Legacy paths:** Do not delete `features/*/bloc/` or `features/*/screens/` at feature root if still imported; add new code under `presentation/`.

